OL,3,AOne dead and several missing after
OL,4,A'terrifying' flash flooding hits Grand
OL,5,ACanyon
OL,6,
OL,7,FOne person has died and 15 remain
OL,8,Fmissing or unaccounted for after flash
OL,9,Fflooding swept through parts of the
OL,10,FGrand Canyon, the National Park Service
OL,11,F(NPS) has said.
OL,13,FThe flood hit Bright Angel Canyon and
OL,14,Fthe Phantom Ranch area on Saturday
OL,15,Fafternoon, wiping out footbridges and
OL,16,Fpropelling boulders downstream.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
