OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AOne dead and several missing after
OL,4,A'terrifying' flash flooding hits Grand
OL,5,ACanyon
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe body of a 46-year-old man was found
OL,8,Fon Sunday evening near Crystal Rapids
OL,9,Falong the Colorado River, the park
OL,10,Fservice told CBS News, the BBC's US
OL,11,Fpartner. Sixty-two people have so far
OL,12,Fbeen airlifted out of the area.
OL,14,F"The whole thing was terrifying," said
OL,15,FNikki Baggs, 41, who was among those to
OL,16,Fbe airlifted out of the bottom of the
OL,17,FGrand Canyon with her two friends.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
